{"f73177a8": "载|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ee595bea": "卫|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "014502d3": "射|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c25916a6": "升|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "71259fb6": "雷|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a74c5425": "客|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "529a8456": "旗|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1490b0bc": "民|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "04482d8c": "币|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "af7a07bd": "纪|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7045b190": "念|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0e80e94a": "程|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "40255293": "雄|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fe1d0bad": "顺|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2c5b5084": "利|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "178654d1": "车字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bba45b68": "单耳旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7249c423": "寸字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b383da01": "十字|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2b9c775c": "雨字头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2fcd9c4a": "宝盖头|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4082afc8": "方字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b020d1f9": "乙字|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "89c02b35": "巾字底|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1556f0cf": "绞丝旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1ed5639e": "心字底|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8e22b6de": "禾木旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "93c14cc8": "隹字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e53cb14c": "页字旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "366e74ed": "立刀旁|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f9fedebb": "雨终于停了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "17744bf7": "我终于学会游泳了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f276dbee": "等了半天，公共汽车终于来了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fa096de6": "妈妈终于回来了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "443a2ee0": "弟弟终于学会骑自行车了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "df30a682": "我终于找到钥匙了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "735bec4a": "花终于开了。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "e9adc1af": "我们终于爬到了山顶。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "347cd756": "载人|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2b7c88af": "卫星|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3edc2be8": "发射|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cec65e54": "升空|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "bd992c4f": "打雷|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fbcde84d": "客人|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6a86f56d": "国旗|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "411720b4": "人民|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2cfc76ef": "人民币|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8598f958": "纪念|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b93a7dd5": "想念|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "f2f34071": "工程|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8e753dc8": "英雄|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8c33eacc": "顺利|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "61494776": "胜利|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "fec2f8c6": "昨天晚上，我们在电视上看火箭发射。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0eb209dd": "火箭一下子就升空了，后面喷着大火。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "febffc92": "声音大得像打雷一样。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cb87aa4f": "这是一艘载人飞船，上面有宇航员。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5d07ea64": "我还知道，天上有很多卫星，能帮我们预报天气。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "66282062": "我长大也想当一名英雄，像宇航员一样。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "65769bd7": "飞船上还有一面国旗。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ee8fccda": "在中国，买东西用的钱叫人民币。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a6147aba": "造一艘飞船，是一个很大的工程。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7a250054": "全国人民都很高兴。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "eecee1d2": "飞船在太空飞了几天，最后顺利回到了地面。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "27764237": "今天家里来了几位客人，我们一起看了录像。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "5c9c83e7": "我们球队赢了！大家一起庆祝胜利。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4b959f83": "谢谢您给我看的那枚纪念币，上面有一艘飞船。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1b0deda1": "爷爷，我很想念您，您什么时候再来我家？|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "ec23a99a": "快来看电视，火箭要发射了！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "cc064d84": "五、四、三、二、一——升空了！声音像打雷一样响！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "2045d17b": "飞船载着三位宇航员，他们要去太空做科学实验。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "00c40349": "我也想去太空当游客！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4a98274a": "宇航员都是了不起的英雄！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "d818fd16": "我这儿有一张纪念邮票和一枚纪念币，上面有飞船和国旗。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "a57265cf": "我们等了差不多十分钟，飞船终于顺利进入太空了！|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "eb2e828f": "造飞船和卫星是很大的工程，全国人民都很高兴。|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "c0683899": "保卫|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "3b8d11e1": "射门|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "96c30a22": "升国旗|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "6478b332": "雷声|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "8666d63d": "做客|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "0fcd1672": "旗子|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "9b1984be": "硬币|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "b431f042": "念书|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "4dd33c5e": "课程|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "1a122856": "顺便|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "7f7c4dc4": "利用|zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural|-15%", "417a5327": "Bingo!|en-US-AvaNeural|-12%"}